# terminal_setup.uaw — terminal-env setup, tap part (UI).
#
# Precondition (runner): target build installed, app at chat.
# Flow: Toolbox -> Command Terminal -> Start Setup -> Notice OK ->
# terminal home with the install running ("Interrupt" proves it started).
# Completion (all packages installed) is the runner's poll job: the
# DEBUGGER "Operit Terminal" row flips to Granted when pnpm+python+pip
# are present (DemoStateManager, command -v checks in the proot session).
#
# Element inventory: drawer hamburger icon only -> TAP_AT 49 110.

EXPECT 15 New Chat
TAP_AT 49 110
TAP Toolbox
SCROLL_TO 4 Command Terminal
TAP Command Terminal
EXPECT 60 Environment Setup
TAP Start Setup
EXPECT 30 Notice
TAP OK
EXPECT 60 Interrupt
